# ==============================================================================
# Celebration & Event Planner - Environment Configuration (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
# Optional: Add your Google Gemini API key below to enable live AI theme & ideas generation.
# Uses gemini-3.5-flash via the official Google AI v1beta endpoint.
#
# SECURITY NOTICE:
# Frontend environment variables prefixed with VITE_ are bundled into client-side code
# and are visible to browser inspection. Never place sensitive administrative keys here.
# For production enterprise deployments, route Gemini calls through an authenticated backend proxy.
#
# Leave empty to use the built-in 100% offline smart recommendation engine.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
